{"id":"n90061-1-4","stage":2,"title":"야외 · 野外","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90061-1-4-1","ko":"이번 주말에는 가족 모두 야외로 놀러 갈까?","zh":"这个周末，我们全家一起去户外玩怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에는","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에는","audio":"/audio/0b27d6d47879bf3eaa83.mp3"}},{"text":"가족","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全。","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"야외로","meaning":"野外，郊外","explanation":"야외：野外，郊外；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"야외","audio":"/audio/76a9e5f2270c1a340670.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90061","senseId":"1","lemma":"야외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야외로","audio":"/audio/760c8f14822ac1a4f41c.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다",